OL,3,GNEWSARural self-driving cars
OL,4,A'nonsense', says expert
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Shadow Chancellor's suggestion to
OL,7,Fintroduce driverless cars into rural
OL,8,Fcommunities "shows a complete lack of
OL,9,Funderstanding" of how the technology
OL,10,Fworks, a motoring journalist has said.
OL,12,FAndrew Griffith told a fringe event at
OL,13,Fthe Conservative Party conference on
OL,14,FMonday that self-driving cars
OL,15,Frepresented a "huge" opportunity to
OL,16,Fhelp elderly and disabled people living
OL,17,Fin the countryside.
