OL,3,GNEWSARural self-driving cars
OL,4,A'nonsense', says expert
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Oxfordshire-based motoring
OL,7,Fjournalist Amanda Stretton disagreed,
OL,8,Ftelling the Today programme on BBC
OL,9,FRadio 4 that the idea was "just
OL,10,Fnonsense".
OL,12,FAutonomous vehicles have become
OL,13,Fcommonplace in some US cities, with
OL,14,FUber becoming the first company to
OL,15,Flaunch self-driving minicabs in London
OL,16,Flast month.
